@startuml Secuencia_CheckIn
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 200

title Diagrama de Secuencia - Check-in mediante Codigo QR

actor "Participante" as Participant
actor "Organizador" as Organizer
participant "App Participante\n(React Native)" as AppP
participant "App Organizador\n(React Native)" as AppO
participant "API REST\n(Spring Boot)" as API
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

== Generacion de Entrada QR ==

Participant -> AppP: Acceder a "Mi Entrada"
activate AppP

AppP -> API: GET /api/events/{eventId}/my-ticket\nAuthorization: Bearer {token}
activate API

API -> API: Extraer userId del JWT

API -> DB: SELECT p.*, e.title, e.location,\ne.start_date, u.name\nFROM participants p\nJOIN events e ON p.event_id = e.id\nJOIN users u ON p.user_id = u.id\nWHERE p.event_id = {eventId}\nAND p.user_id = {userId}
activate DB
DB --> API: TicketData
deactivate DB

API --> AppP: TicketResponse\n{eventTitle, userName,\ncheckinToken, status}
deactivate API

AppP -> AppP: Generar codigo QR\ncon checkin_token

AppP --> Participant: Mostrar entrada\ncon codigo QR
deactivate AppP

== Proceso de Check-in ==

Organizer -> AppO: Acceder a "Escanear"
activate AppO

AppO -> AppO: Activar camara
AppO --> Organizer: Mostrar visor de camara

Participant -> Organizer: Presentar codigo QR

AppO -> AppO: Detectar y decodificar QR
AppO -> AppO: Extraer checkin_token

AppO -> API: POST /api/events/{eventId}/checkin\nAuthorization: Bearer {token}\nBody: {token: "{checkin_token}"}
activate API

API -> API: Extraer organizerId del JWT

API -> DB: SELECT organizer_id FROM events\nWHERE id = {eventId}
activate DB
DB --> API: organizer_id
deactivate DB

alt No es organizador
    API --> AppO: 403 Forbidden\n"No autorizado"
end

API -> DB: SELECT p.*, u.name, u.email\nFROM participants p\nJOIN users u ON p.user_id = u.id\nWHERE p.event_id = {eventId}\nAND p.checkin_token = {token}
activate DB
DB --> API: Participant data
deactivate DB

alt Token no encontrado
    API --> AppO: 404 Not Found\n"Codigo QR invalido"
end

alt Ya hizo check-in
    API --> AppO: 400 Bad Request\n"Participante ya registrado"\n{checkedInAt: "..."}
end

API -> DB: UPDATE participants\nSET attendance_status = 'ATTENDED',\nchecked_in_at = NOW()\nWHERE id = {participantId}
activate DB
DB --> API: Updated
deactivate DB

API --> AppO: CheckinResponse\n{success: true,\nuserName: "...",\ncheckedInAt: "..."}
deactivate API

AppO --> Organizer: Mostrar confirmacion\ncon nombre del participante
deactivate AppO

== Consulta de Lista de Asistencia ==

Organizer -> AppO: Ver lista de asistencia
activate AppO

AppO -> API: GET /api/events/{eventId}/attendance-list\nAuthorization: Bearer {token}
activate API

API -> DB: SELECT p.*, u.name, u.email\nFROM participants p\nJOIN users u ON p.user_id = u.id\nWHERE p.event_id = {eventId}\nORDER BY p.checked_in_at DESC
activate DB
DB --> API: List<Participant>
deactivate DB

API --> AppO: List<AttendanceItemResponse>\n[{userName, status, checkedInAt}, ...]
deactivate API

AppO --> Organizer: Mostrar lista de asistentes\ncon estado de check-in
deactivate AppO

@enduml
